			title="ACE Fortify - delete if unused";
			description="In description.ext you can add/remove objects in the preset for players to build, then edit and copy the hammer's init box as needed, for [side, budget, objectArray] params to initialize fortify on trigger  or just use the module if fortify does not need to be triggered." \n "Rules for placement can be adjusted in init.sqf." \n "There's another module under ACE for defining a build area as well, and make sure players have access to fortify tools.";
			id=1650;
		};
